Add a chance-of-precipitation chart to the today page.

The lower half of that page is empty apart from the watermark. This fills it
with the next nine hours of precipitation probability, in the same hatched-bar
style as the hourly page.

Drawn as inline SVG rather than the canvas + rough.js the hourly page uses: no
script has to run before the screenshot is taken, so the chart cannot come out
half-drawn, and there is nothing to load.

Adds an `_extra_body` hook to SimplifiedPage so the today page can append to the
content section without reimplementing the whole template.

